OL,3,GNEWSACity bar's licence suspended after
OL,4,Athree men stabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Liverpool city centre bar has had its
OL,7,Flicence suspended after three men were
OL,8,Fstabbed at the weekend.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Tithebarn Street
OL,11,Fat abut 06:35 BST on Sunday to reports
OL,12,Fof an altercation between two groups
OL,13,Finside GBar in nearby Eberle Street
OL,14,Fwhich is thought to have continued
OL,15,Foutside.
OL,17,FLiverpool City Council's licensing
OL,18,Fcommittee has suspended the venue's
OL,19,Flicence pending another hearing.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
